      58.56,
      524.05,
      538.37,
      613.03
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thunder showers will occur at a several places in Central, Uva and Eastern provinces and in Polonnaruwa and Hambantota districts after 1.00 p.m. and, fairly heavy falls above 50 mm are likely at some places in these areas. Mainly fair weather conditions are expected in other areas of the Island.",
